sequenceDiagram
    actor Staff as Nhan vien le tan
    participant UI as ThongKePanel
    participant QLKS as QuanLyKhachSan
    participant MonthChart as BieuDoDoanhThuPanel
    participant TypeChart as BieuDoDoanhThuTheoLoaiPanel

    Staff->>UI: Mo trang thong ke hoac nhan Lam moi
    UI->>UI: capNhatDuLieuThongKe()
    UI->>QLKS: getDanhSachPhong()
    QLKS-->>UI: dsPhong
    UI->>QLKS: getDanhSachPhieu()
    QLKS-->>UI: dsPhieu
    UI->>UI: Dem phong theo trang thai va khoi tao bo dem luot thue

    loop Duyet tung phieu
        UI->>UI: Bo qua neu khong co phong dem luot thue neu co phong
        alt Phieu co phong va trang thai DA_TRA
            UI->>UI: Tinh tong tien = truoc thue + VAT
            UI->>UI: Xac dinh thang tu maPhieu (loi thi mac dinh 01/2026)
            UI->>UI: Cong doanh thu tong theo phong thang va loai phong
        else Phieu khong co phong hoac trang thai khac DA_TRA
            UI->>UI: Khong cong doanh thu
        end
    end

    UI->>UI: Cap nhat 5 the bang doanh thu Top 3 va Top 5
    UI->>MonthChart: setData(mapDoanhThuThang) va repaint()
    UI->>TypeChart: setData(mapDoanhThuThangVaLoai) va repaint()
    UI-->>Staff: Hien thi thong ke da cap nhat